{"4374280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brotherhood of Pain", "steam_appid": 4374280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4818740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound to the will of the necromancer Zndan, you and your party are dragged back from death. Conquer cursed dungeons, loot the rarest artifacts, endure resurrections, and fight to reclaim your souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Brotherhood of Pain</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort a power crystal through hostile dungeons and defend it against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147f5c98225dc6147a.poster.avif?t=1780567070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147f5c98225dc6147a.webm?t=1780567070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147f5c98225dc6147a.mp4?t=1780567070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>12 unique classes</strong>, each offering distinct playstyles and synergies. Plan your character’s growth through an <strong>intricate stat system</strong>. Will you become a luck-driven wizard, or an intelligence-based rogue?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/727af4551aae98b266144ce14f1fb3e0.poster.avif?t=1780567070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/727af4551aae98b266144ce14f1fb3e0.webm?t=1780567070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot fallen enemies and unexplored rooms to uncover <strong>unique items of immense power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/9e2ccf3e00a638a7931e5a3581d53164.poster.avif?t=1780567070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/9e2ccf3e00a638a7931e5a3581d53164.webm?t=1780567070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your journey carefully and <strong>light rooms wisely</strong>. Darkness increases the danger, but also the rewards.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound to the will of the necromancer Zndan, you and your party are dragged back from death. Conquer cursed dungeons, loot the rarest artifacts, endure resurrections, and fight to reclaim your souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Brotherhood of Pain</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort a power crystal through hostile dungeons and defend it against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147f5c98225dc6147a.poster.avif?t=1780567070\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147f5c98225dc6147a.webm?t=1780567070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374280/extras/51543eab2c52a2147